  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SUjIbduF\">由于广告各实例中的数据量都比较大（经常会有上万的账户/广告数据需要处理）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-n5wCkZA1\">在脚本的编程中，列表数据的检索我们将采用选择器和迭代器进行取值，因此你不需要再编写冗杂的代码处理那些复杂的数据分页处理</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MCdM8ud4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-siPDcJfI\">选择器：xxxSelector()，用于从类中提取一个Selector对象，并可以通过各种检索方法圈定缩小范围</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1E5mC0Z3\">迭代器：selector.iterator()，从selector中产生一个迭代器，用来做循环遍历操作</li></ul><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-WA7jV2ID\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZrKm9vXV\">注意：由于迭代器在遍历时，会进行网络请求拉取数据，所以需要通过 for await 来发起同步请求</p></blockquote><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-9J574HBV\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-V1im1iCm\">出于性能考虑，我们封装了基于选择器的异步并行执行方式：selector.forEachAsyncParallel(callbackFn)，该方法能实现一定程度的异步并行执行能力。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-C0HMJljP\">另外你也可以使用标准的Promise方法实现异步能力。</li></ul><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-2kUq8d9X\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-2kUq8d9X\">例子1：广告报表获取</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%20%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%20main%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%20*%2F%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%9B%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%86%E6%9B%B4%E6%B8%85%E6%99%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%9D%A5%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%82%E3%80%82%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%20%5B%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5D%20%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E7%9A%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%99%A8%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%20MAPI%20%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%9A%20https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1741387668314126%5Cn%20%20const%20reportRowsSelector%20%3D%20adv.reportSelector()%5Cn%20%20%20%20.withDataTopic('BASIC_DATA')%5Cn%20%20%20%20.withStartTime('2023-11-01')%5Cn%20%20%20%20.withEndTime('2023-11-10')%3B%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%99%A8%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%20selector.iterator()%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%E5%99%A8%5Cn%20%20const%20reportRows%20%3D%20reportRowsSelector.iterator()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20for%20await%20(const%20row%20of%20reportRows)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20console.log(row)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%A2%84%E6%9C%9F%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20return%20'ok'%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g2WEb%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-qGllM8Q9\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-WGFh8o1o\">例子2：广告账户获取</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%20%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%20main%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%20*%2F%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20const%20advIds%20%3D%20%5B1%2C%202%2C%203%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20for...of%20%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%20advIds%20%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%5Cn%20%20for%20(const%20advId%20of%20advIds)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20console.log(advId)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%A2%84%E6%9C%9F%E4%BE%9D%E6%AC%A1%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%201%2C%202%2C%203%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%81%9A%E4%BA%86%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%EF%BC%8C%E6%82%A8%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%9B%B4%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%E8%AF%B7%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%20%5B%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5D%20%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%20MAPI%20%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%9A%20https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1696710516003852%5Cn%20%20const%20advs%20%3D%20agent.advSelector().iterator()%3B%5Cn%20%20for%20await%20(const%20adv%20of%20advs)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20console.log(adv)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%A2%84%E6%9C%9F%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BBID%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E4%B8%AD%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E9%A1%B9%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%5Cn%20%20return%20'ok'%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HJPbU%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-89j4OmCB\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-89j4OmCB\">例子3：遍历执行的三种方式</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%20%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%20main%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%20*%2F%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%5Cn%20%20const%20agents%20%3D%20await%20Mapi.getAgents()%3B%5Cn%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%5Cn%20%20for%20(const%20agent%20of%20agents)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20advSelector%20%3D%20agent.advSelector()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%20selector.iterator()%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%E5%99%A8%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20advs%20%3D%20advSelector.iterator()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20await%20(const%20adv%20of%20advs)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20console.log(adv)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20await%20adv.getFund()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%20selector.forEachAsyncParallel%20%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%5Cn%20%20%20%20await%20advSelector.forEachAsyncParallel(async%20(adv)%20%3D%3E%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20console.log(adv)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20await%20adv.getFund()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D%E7%BB%88%E6%AD%A2%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20throw%20new%20Mapi.ShouldBreakError()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%89%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20Promise.all%20%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%8C%20selector.forEachAsyncParallel%20%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20promises%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20advs2%20%3D%20advSelector.iterator()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20await%20(const%20adv%20of%20advs2)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20console.log(adv)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20task%20%3D%20async%20()%20%3D%3E%20await%20adv.getFund()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20promises.push(task)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20await%20Promise.all(promises)%3B%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20return%20'ok'%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22id%22%3A%221xfPv%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-c5WGdKPA\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-YP71FoJj\">了解更多</h1><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-FbKgdWXr\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-isTsdezF\">脚本工具支持完整 ES6 语法</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2WPeCzYR\"><a href=\"https://www.babeljs.cn/docs/learn#iterators--forof\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">iterators, for...of</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1FjovqaX\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/for-await...of\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">for-await...of</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KZO2Z0ND\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/all\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">Promise.all()</a></li></ul></div>",
